their own licences, which ship beside them (Inter-LICENSE.txt and
JetBrainsMono-LICENSE.txt, both SIL Open Font License 1.1) and are unaffected by the
terms above. Declared npm dependencies are not distributed with this snapshot; they
are installed by the reader under their own licences.

